OL,3,GNEWSAMusical about me 'better not be
OL,4,Arubbish' warns Allardyce
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe writer of a new musical about one
OL,7,Fof football's most colourful characters
OL,8,Fhas revealed that he has been warned in
OL,9,Fno uncertain terms that it had "better
OL,10,Fnot be rubbish".
OL,12,FLifelong Bolton Wanderers fan Jamie
OL,13,FWalsh is telling the story of his
OL,14,Fclub's legendary manager Sam Allardyce,
OL,15,Fwho led The Trotters from 1999 until
OL,16,F2007.
OL,18,FHis hugely successful Wanderers side
OL,19,Feven defied the odds to finish sixth in
OL,20,Fthe Premier League in the 2004-05
OL,21,Fseason and qualify for European
OL,22,Ffootball.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
